---
import BaseLayout from '@/layouts/BaseLayout.astro'
import Signoff from '@/components/Signoff.astro'
---

<BaseLayout
  title="About — Lindsay Wardell"
  description="Programmer and writer. Engineering Manager at Mangomint. Fiction, poetry, and tools that bring people together."
>
  <article class="about-page px-2 md:px-0 pb-16">
    <div
      class="about-page-surface prose prose-lg md:prose-xl bg-background rounded p-5 md:p-10 max-w-none"
    >
      <h1
        class="about-page-title font-title text-3xl md:text-4xl text-center text-pretty !mb-8 !mt-0"
      >
        Hi, I'm Lindsay Wardell
      </h1>

      <img
        src="/lindsay2.jpg"
        alt="Lindsay Wardell"
        class="about-page-portrait aspect-square object-cover object-top w-[min(100%,18rem)] rounded-lg border border-divider/40 mx-auto mb-6 md:float-right md:mx-0 md:ml-8 md:mb-4 md:mt-1"
        loading="eager"
        decoding="async"
        width="288"
        height="288"
      />

      <p class="text-pretty">
        I'm a programmer and writer. I've been working in software since 2015,
        and I currently work as an Engineering Manager at{' '}
        <a href="https://mangomint.com">Mangomint</a>. I've worked on projects
        for individuals and small businesses as well as large organizations. I
        love talking to people about what they do, what they care about, and
        what their experiences have been like.
      </p>
      <p class="text-pretty">
        Writing has always been a passion of mine. In elementary school I wrote
        the heartfelt epic of "The Adventures of Jake" as he quested around the
        world fighting bad guys and collecting the chaos emeralds (I was a big
        fan of Sonic the Hedgehog). In middle school I turned to drawing comics
        (again Sonic themed) and started writing stories for tabletop
        roleplaying games. In high school I discovered a joy for worldbuilding,
        and started writing my first novel (which has been regrettably
        misplaced).
      </p>
      <p class="text-pretty">
        As a young adult, I kept coming back to writing fiction, and later
        poetry, as a way to explore what I was feeling and seeing around me.
        Creative expression is something I'm always searching for (I also love
        singing and playing viola), but in writing I felt like I found a voice
        and flow. I could create a world, a story, a set of rules. Today, I
        continue to explore those worlds, drawing them and telling their
        stories. I'm currently working on a fantasy novel, which I hope to share
        with the world some time in the next year or so.
      </p>
      <p class="text-pretty">
        Professionally, I've worked on a number of projects ranging from a
        corporate application to a 5-person startup. I've used common tools
        (like React or Ruby on Rails) as well as less known ones (such as Elm or
        Haskell). Personally, I enjoy working with a functional programming
        lens, because I find it helps me organize what I am doing, but I
        appreciate the power in object-oriented languages like Kotlin and C#.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="about-page-signoff max-w-2xl mx-auto pt-10 md:pt-12">
      <Signoff iconsOnly />
    </div>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .about-page-surface {
    box-shadow: var(--shadow-paper);
    animation: about-settle 0.75s cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1) both;
  }

  .about-page-title {
    animation: about-settle 0.65s cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1) both;
  }

  .about-page-portrait {
    transform: scale(1.02);
    transform-origin: center;
    animation: about-portrait 1.1s cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1) 0.06s both;
  }

  .about-page-signoff {
    animation: about-settle 0.7s cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1) 0.12s both;
  }

  .about-page-surface :global(a) {
    color: var(--color-hover);
    text-decoration: underline;
    text-underline-offset: 3px;
    transition: color 0.15s ease;
  }

  .about-page-surface :global(a:hover) {
    color: var(--color-foreground);
  }

  .about-page-surface :global(a:focus-visible) {
    outline: 2px solid var(--color-hover);
    outline-offset: 3px;
    border-radius: 2px;
  }

  @keyframes about-settle {
    from {
      opacity: 0;
      transform: translateY(0.55rem);
    }
    to {
      opacity: 1;
      transform: none;
    }
  }

  @keyframes about-portrait {
    from {
      transform: scale(1.02);
      opacity: 0.85;
    }
    to {
      transform: scale(1);
      opacity: 1;
    }
  }

  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
    .about-page-surface,
    .about-page-title,
    .about-page-portrait,
    .about-page-signoff {
      animation: none;
    }

    .about-page-portrait {
      transform: none;
      opacity: 1;
    }

    .about-page-surface :global(a) {
      transition: none;
    }
  }
</style>
